# Trained model artifacts (ocean_eye_cls.pt, discriminator.joblib, calibrator.joblib,
# calibration_real_val.json), the localizer-consistent training crops, and the prepared
# train/val split are all intentionally NOT ignored - a fresh clone gets the exact same trained
# models and intermediate data this machine has, with nothing to regenerate.
# Only genuinely disposable Ultralytics scratch space stays excluded:
backend/ml_artifacts/runs/
backend/ml_artifacts/weights_cache/

frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.env
